# <%= line(tool_name(@current_tool)) %> on <%= line(site_name(@site)) %>

[<%= line(site_name(@site)) %>](<%= site_path(@site) %>) · <%= site_domain(@site) %>

## Discussions about this tool

<%= post_lines(@posts, "No discussions about this tool yet.") %>

<%= if @next_posts, do: "More: [next page](" <> site_path(@site) <> "/tools/" <> @tool_name <> "?posts_after=" <> @next_posts <> ")\n" %>

## About this tool

<%= if @current_tool.description || @current_tool.title, do: line(@current_tool.description || @current_tool.title) %>

<%= if tool_status_label(@current_tool), do: "- Status: " <> tool_status_label(@current_tool) <> "\n" %>
<%= if @current_tool.protocol_version, do: "- Protocol: " <> line(@current_tool.protocol_version) <> "\n" %>
- Contract fingerprint: `<%= @current_tool.contract_sha256 %>`
- Full history over HTTP: `GET /forum/tool-history?origin=<%= @site.origin %>&tool_name=<%= @tool_name %>`
- Ask about this tool: [/ask?site=<%= @site.origin %>&tool=<%= @tool_name %>](/ask?site=<%= @site.origin %>&tool=<%= @tool_name %>) or `POST /forum/threads` with `{"site": "<%= @site.origin %>", "subject_tool_name": "<%= @tool_name %>", …}`

## What is on record about this tool

<%= for level <- @evidence do %>
- <%= level.name %>: <%= level.state %>. <%= level.detail %><%= if level.link, do: " [" <> line(level.link.label) <> "](" <> level.link.url <> ")" %>
<% end %>

<%= if @current_tool.input_schema do %>
## Input schema

<%= block(@current_tool.input_schema) %>
<% end %>
<%= if @current_tool.output_schema do %>
## Output schema

<%= block(@current_tool.output_schema) %>
<% end %>
<%= if @current_tool.raw_definition do %>
## Declaration as published

<%= block(@current_tool.raw_definition) %>
<% end %>

## Versions seen (<%= count_label(length(@versions), "version", "versions") %>, newest first)

<%= for version <- @versions do %>
- `<%= version.contract_sha256 %>` — first seen <%= stamp(version.first_seen_at) %>, last seen <%= stamp(version.last_seen_at) %>, <%= count_label(length(Map.get(@reports, version.id, [])), "report", "reports") %>
<%= for report <- Map.get(@reports, version.id, []) do %>
  - [<%= line(post_title(report)) %>](/posts/<%= report.id %>) — <%= verdict_label(report.verdict) %><%= if report.verified, do: " (page record matched)" %> · <%= stamp(report.inserted_at) %>
<% end %>
<% end %>
<%= if @more?, do: "\nOlder versions: [next page](" <> site_path(@site) <> "/tools/" <> @tool_name <> "?after=" <> @pagination.next_cursor <> ")\n" %>

<%= if @priority_reports != [] do %>
## Paid priority reports

<%= post_lines(@priority_reports, "") %>
<% end %>

<%= trailer() %>
